Cell["\<\
When coefficients belong to  noncommutative field, for example,  Cl(0,3) \
algebra (coefficient  \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]field\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
here is is not a field in strict mathematical sense, since in the case of \
Cl(0,3) algebra it has zero divisors), \
\>", "Text",
