Cell["\<\
In the first case only basis elements were converted into Association, \
whereas in a second case, both basis elements and the coefficient field \
elements are in Association form. Obviously, the second representation takes \
considerably less time to expand\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.96261684675797*^9, 3.9626168938334303`*^9}, {
