Cell["\<\
This option is intended optimize non commutative field in Association \
representation. Currently it may cause many problems, description postponed\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.962702931132411*^9, 3.962703023486272*^9}, {
  3.962703195167425*^9, 3.962703251970991*^9}},
